<title>CHINA: Shangling '96 net plunges 93.71 pct.</title>
<headline>Shangling '96 net plunges 93.71 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(millions of yuan unless stated, against 1995 figures)</p>
<p> Turnover	  1,350.796    vs	   1,924.571</p>
<p> Net profit	   10.366    vs	     164.727</p>
<p> Net asset per share  3.54  yuan  vs     3.94 yuan</p>
<p> Earnings per share   0.032 yuan  vs     0.60 yuan</p>
<p>Company name: Shanghai Shangling Electric Appliances Co Ltd.</p>
<p>Note: The results were published in a company statement on Monday. The figures are based on domestic accounting standards. Figures based on international accounting standards were not available.</p>
<p>The company's board of directors proposed not to issue any cash dividend, pending approval of a shareholders meeting.</p>
</text>
